{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537620/extras/889f73285910874778750939cfda5d6f.avif?t=1759500371\" width=666 height=110 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After discovering that my family had been murdered in their mansion, I reached out to the authorities in search of answers, only to be met with silence and dead ends. I decided to enter the mansion, armed only with my camcorder, to record and find out what truly happened to my family.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537620/extras/4b503083cb0c9c5cf4f1d1b65937f548.avif?t=1759500371\" width=666 height=104 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Something is inside the mansion, I switched on my microphone and let the quiet settle in before asking the first question:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cHow did you die?\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537620/extras/4b8ffe3ed92ae330a7a0d42f0ed08a15.poster.avif?t=1759500371\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537620/extras/4b8ffe3ed92ae330a7a0d42f0ed08a15.webm?t=1759500371\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537620/extras/4b8ffe3ed92ae330a7a0d42f0ed08a15.mp4?t=1759500371\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537620/extras/59a2da1d9aefbf886e4165658c126f34.avif?t=1759500371\" width=666 height=96 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I must record everything for the world to see, I can't miss anything. I turn on my camcorder and step inside to uncover the truth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537620/extras/409d28b838c7afbe5a89d2ee06156bb8.avif?t=1759500371\" width=666 height=74 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I\u2019m determined to uncover every hidden detail, inside this mansion.  No bookcase, painting, or door will go unchecked, every corner holds a secret waiting to be revealed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537620/extras/d2e384b31ca51dc862f706371319963a.poster.avif?t=1759500371\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537620/extras/d2e384b31ca51dc862f706371319963a.webm?t=1759500371\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537620/extras/d2e384b31ca51dc862f706371319963a.mp4?t=1759500371\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537620/extras/8e4f028d42119ad3b4501d4f91355568.avif?t=1759500371\" width=666 height=77 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I searched around the house to find clues of my family's tragedy. I found newspaper articles that never saw the light of day and my brother's notes documenting his nightmare.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537620/extras/4de25a35d392c8883081ef55c55fa4b3.poster.avif?t=1759500371\" width=1152 height=648 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537620/extras/4de25a35d392c8883081ef55c55fa4b3.webm?t=1759500371\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537620/extras/4de25a35d392c8883081ef55c55fa4b3.mp4?t=1759500371\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537620/extras/558ad289e5c4e3a31d4f7fc439b7e27a.avif?t=1759500371\" width=666 height=74 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It seems my family tried to block whatever was chasing them. I must solve these puzzles and make it to the end.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537620/extras/704ad0d9171a1af8ee8cd919dcbcfebd.poster.avif?t=1759500371\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537620/extras/704ad0d9171a1af8ee8cd919dcbcfebd.webm?t=1759500371\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537620/extras/704ad0d9171a1af8ee8cd919dcbcfebd.mp4?t=1759500371\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537620/extras/4d744d4e193fc302fb22384fac8b13d8.avif?t=1759500371\" width=666 height=67 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First Person horror game exploration</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Voice Recognition</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the story through Note Collection</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve Puzzles &amp; Riddles</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3537620?t=1759500371","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537620/4bb43e2db5197af16322f1ecad08e3d3682798c3/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759500371","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537620/ca3700b557ac1d590d3cfb530d0b579d4d100206/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759500371","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537620/ca3700b557ac1d590d3cfb530d0b579d4d100206/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759500371","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3539000,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537620/extras/889f73285910874778750939cfda5d6f.avif?t=1759500371\" width=666 height=110 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After discovering that my family had been murdered in their mansion, I reached out to the authorities in search of answers, only to be met with silence and dead ends. I decided to enter the mansion, armed only with my camcorder, to record and find out what truly happened to my family.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537620/extras/4b503083cb0c9c